      "note": "We will test the repair in Phi, a second\nmodel family.\n\nA helper completed a subtask, but\nscreening ended before whole-task\nassessment. Next: working alone, or one\nhelper chosen by fixed or adaptive rules.\nAll share 96 calls and 8,192 output\ntokens, with no extra child budget."
